{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12231070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12231070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1223107001:0":{"text":"整理得太棒了，有机会，一定让我招待您吃饭！","source_cn":"整理得太棒了，有机会，一定让我招待您吃饭！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9493C1840BD5AD22","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"整理得太棒了，有机会，一定让我招待您吃饭！","female":"整理得太棒了，有机会，一定让我招待您吃饭！","variant_male_record_index":"139704","variant_female_record_index":"139705","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223107002:0":{"text":"哼，看在<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的面子上，我就不要你们赔偿货损了。","source_cn":"哼，看在<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9BC5CB275CE87C15","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"哼，看在<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的面子上，我就不要你们赔偿货损了。","female":"哼，看在<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的面子上，我就不要你们赔偿货损了。","variant_male_record_index":"139706","variant_female_record_index":"139707","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223107003:1":{"text":"认命吧，你们在锈锚港不可能找到活的！","source_cn":"认命吧，你们在锈锚港不可能找到活的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD2951AF5C8C0F6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223107004:1":{"text":"老子偏不认命！要不是阿尔不让打砸抢，我们还用得着受这窝囊气？","source_cn":"老子偏不认命！要不是阿尔不让打砸抢，我们还用得着受这窝囊气？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AA45DB769D5D826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223107005:1":{"text":"大不了就重操旧业呗。","source_cn":"大不了就重操旧业呗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5EC9E5B51A873F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223107006:1":{"text":"打砸抢不也是一份工作吗？","source_cn":"打砸抢不也是一份工作吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E84F00B737B46F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223107007:1":{"text":"上一个在锈锚港打砸抢的死潮舰队，骨头已经沉到海底了。","source_cn":"上一个在锈锚港打砸抢的死潮舰队，骨头已经沉到海底了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9DA72A722CA0E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223107008:1":{"text":"混蛋们，别忘了是谁放你们进锈锚港的。","source_cn":"混蛋们，别忘了是谁放你们进锈锚港的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8355E7F6D6CE69EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223107009:1":{"text":"血薇帮既然可以放你们进来，也能让你们永远消失。","source_cn":"血薇帮既然可以放你们进来，也能让你们永远消失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x861070F3854546D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223107010:1":{"text":"真是笑话！别说的好像锈锚港是只属于你们的地盘一样。","source_cn":"真是笑话！别说的好像锈锚港是只属于你们的地盘一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x791CE4490375F84E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_re